{"3709130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Largitas: Fragments of War", "steam_appid": 3709130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the far future, humanity had progressed to its pinnacle in terms of scientific and spiritual advancement, colonizing countless star systems. Yet suddenly, a majority of the population disappeared, with the reason for their disappearance lost in the chaos and confusion that followed. Now, in this period of great conflict and instability, the remnants of humanity are left to fight over the scraps that were left behind of their once-great civilization.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Largitas</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709130/extras/afb987284c7888a95643bffbb1cc2807.avif?t=1781284427\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an independent operator on the harsh and dangerous surface of Largitas, a harsh, backwater planet. Only outcasts, criminals, the unlucky and the foolish get constrained on this planet, and you will have to fight just to survive. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore over 8 unique locations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709130/extras/86a9416c927bb68631646ade07cd20d4.avif?t=1780851132\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locations are procedurally generated; exploring the same location provides a different experience each time. Each location contains its own unique aspects, threats, and loot, and you will need different strategies to best survive each one.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock and customize new equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709130/extras/6e0a59ab24e82a1e0efab7de825a1808.avif?t=1780851132\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Install modules into your suit and upgrades into your weapons to upgrade their performance and customize the way you approach encounters. Unlock powerful abilities through a skill system that allow you to gain the upper hand. Over time, purchase better sets of equipment to combat the ever-evolving threats you will have to face.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet unusual and interesting characters</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709130/extras/0bd50338c437068e34fb284b24a793b5.avif?t=1781284427\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form bonds with the people you meet on Largitas and learn their stories. Choose factions to fight for and ones to fight against, or juggle your relations with everyone if you wish to stay neutral. Decide not only your own fate, but also the fates of those close to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the far future, humanity had progressed to its pinnacle in terms of scientific and spiritual advancement, colonizing countless star systems. Yet suddenly, a majority of the population disappeared, with the reason for their disappearance lost in the chaos and confusion that followed. Now, in this period of great conflict and instability, the remnants of humanity are left to fight over the scraps that were left behind of their once-great civilization.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Largitas</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709130/extras/afb987284c7888a95643bffbb1cc2807.avif?t=1781284427\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an independent operator on the harsh and dangerous surface of Largitas, a harsh, backwater planet. Only outcasts, criminals, the unlucky and the foolish get constrained on this planet, and you will have to fight just to survive. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore over 8 unique locations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709130/extras/86a9416c927bb68631646ade07cd20d4.avif?t=1780851132\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locations are procedurally generated; exploring the same location provides a different experience each time. Each location contains its own unique aspects, threats, and loot, and you will need different strategies to best survive each one.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock and customize new equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709130/extras/6e0a59ab24e82a1e0efab7de825a1808.avif?t=1780851132\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Install modules into your suit and upgrades into your weapons to upgrade their performance and customize the way you approach encounters. Unlock powerful abilities through a skill system that allow you to gain the upper hand. Over time, purchase better sets of equipment to combat the ever-evolving threats you will have to face.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet unusual and interesting characters</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709130/extras/0bd50338c437068e34fb284b24a793b5.avif?t=1781284427\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form bonds with the people you meet on Largitas and learn their stories. Choose factions to fight for and ones to fight against, or juggle your relations with everyone if you wish to stay neutral. Decide not only your own fate, but also the fates of those close to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A 2D top-down extraction shooter set in a world where most of humanity has disappeared. Explore and scavenge a dangerous planet with the aid of your mechanized Aether Beast. Upgrade and customize your equipment, explore mysterious ruins, and interact with the people and factions on the planet.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709130/33059e7da64f47ff71995acf7b68d17e85b9919b/header.jpg?t=1785032851", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709130/4065c3d4bcda25ddf0764b2ca9aaa415e0569421/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785032851", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709130/4065c3d4bcda25ddf0764b2ca9aaa415e0569421/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785032851", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated graphics card</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Gloomy Lantern"], "publishers": ["Gloomy Lantern"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 67, "description": "Camera Comfort"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 78, "description": "Adjustable Difficulty"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709130/e50d68e69006ae42aca60b068be4668d61364380/ss_e50d68e69006ae42aca60b068be4668d61364380.600x338.jpg?t=1785032851", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709130/e50d68e69006ae42aca60b068be4668d61364380/ss_e50d68e69006ae42aca60b068be4668d61364380.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785032851"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709130/d05e1c7cd0a2753c8ebd844d56895040092b303a/ss_d05e1c7cd0a2753c8ebd844d56895040092b303a.600x338.jpg?t=1785032851", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709130/d05e1c7cd0a2753c8ebd844d56895040092b303a/ss_d05e1c7cd0a2753c8ebd844d56895040092b303a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785032851"}, {"id": 2, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709130/30ed4397e80cfe7c6fd4ff7c11e300a5bf158ead/ss_30ed4397e80cfe7c6fd4ff7c11e300a5bf158ead.600x338.jpg?t=1785032851", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709130/30ed4397e80cfe7c6fd4ff7c11e300a5bf158ead/ss_30ed4397e80cfe7c6fd4ff7c11e300a5bf158ead.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785032851"}, {"id": 3, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709130/a8ff7deadffe0a14a6c0572fecde279f8b00484f/ss_a8ff7deadffe0a14a6c0572fecde279f8b00484f.600x338.jpg?t=1785032851", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709130/a8ff7deadffe0a14a6c0572fecde279f8b00484f/ss_a8ff7deadffe0a14a6c0572fecde279f8b00484f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785032851"}, {"id": 4, "path_t